{{wikipedia|dab=settler (disambiguation)|settler}}
==English==

===Etymology===
{{-er|settle}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}
{{wikipedia}}

# someone who [[settle]]s in a new [[location]], especially one who makes a previously [[uninhabited]] place his [[home]]
# someone who [[decide]]s something, such as a [[dispute]]
# {{British}} the person in a [[betting shop]] who [[calculate]]s the [[winnings]]
# a drink which settles the stomach, especially a bitter drink, often a nightcap

